      ],
      "key": "performed_evaluation_core_totality",
      "statement": "Every performed evaluation returns exactly one core value directly or via a refinement. Constraints, judgments, frame evaluations, stops, work steps and effects use this one core or mapped refinements; a combination cannot hide or coerce a required failure, undecided question, unperformed evaluation or uncertain effect into success.",
      "uncertainty": ""
